Convert (fork)

This repository is a fork of p2r3/convert (https://github.com/p2r3/convert),
"Convert to it!", by p2r3 and its contributors. It is licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2. See LICENSE.

Changes in this fork are Copyright (c) 2026 Lucas Van De Weerd and are
licensed under the same licence. CHANGELOG.md lists the changed and added
files with the date of the change.

